+- Totem API (BFF for `pegafila_totem`), see [`docs/api/totem.md`](docs/api/totem.md): pairing login (`POST api/totem/auth`, JWT HS256 via `firebase/php-jwt`), queues, priorities and ticket issuance through `IssueTicket` with channel `totem`. Includes the `totems`, `totem_presets` and `totem_preset_queue` migrations, `totem:pairing-code {preset}` artisan command, `totem.auth` middleware, per-path entity/queue scope checks, rate limits (10/min pairing, 30/min ticket issuance), audit entries for pairing, and CORS for localhost/127.0.0.1 origins.
