+## CORS
+
+The totem's web build runs on a local static server in development. The
+`api/*` paths answer CORS for `http(s)://localhost[:port]` and
+`http(s)://127.0.0.1[:port]`, plus the exact origin in `TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN`
+(optional). Other origins get no `Access-Control-Allow-Origin`. No credentials
+are allowed. Config: `config/cors.php`.
