 | **Archive only** | `Log::debug`/`info` traces; validation errors; 404s; Telescope noise; Discord soft-fail (`Discord ops alert failed`); expected business rejects (inactive queue) |
-| **Audit** (not Discord) | Login failure / lockout (when auth lands); membership role changes; subscription status transitions; webhook received + idempotent skip/apply outcome |
+| **Audit** (not Discord) | Login failure / lockout (when auth lands); membership role changes; subscription status transitions; webhook received + idempotent skip/apply outcome; totem pairing window opened, totem paired, totem pairing failed (reason only, never the code) |
 
